What each model category does :

| Category           | Purpose             |
| ------------------ | ------------------- |
| NumPy/Pandas       | Handle data         |
| Scikit-Learn       | Train models        |
| Git                | Version control     |
| FastAPI            | Expose model as API |
| Docker             | Package app         |
| AWS/Azure/GCP      | Run app on internet |
| GitHub Actions     | Auto deployment     |
| MLflow             | Track experiments   |
| DVC                | Track data/models   |
| Airflow            | Automate workflows  |
| Kubernetes         | Scale containers    |
| Prometheus/Grafana | Monitoring          |

